<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais set calls on petrochemical basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais set calls on petrochemical basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Gurnsey) has issued 900 million American-style call warrants, on petrochemical stocks, lead manager Credit Lyonnais Paris said.</p>
<p>The unequally weighted basket includes shares of Shanghai Petrochemical, Jilin Chemical Industrial, CNPC (Hong Kong) and Zhenhai Refining &amp; Chemical.</p>
<p>One basket is controlled by 10 warrants.  STRIKE PRICE    HK$1.6532		 PREMIUM	16.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.0746		 GEARING	2.77 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	25.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	12.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 MIN EXER LOT 20,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  HK$2.0665  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
